          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Canke ndungitse icago muri ico gihugu, nkagisukako uburake bwanje mu gusesa amaraso, nkica abantu baho bose n’ibikoko vyaho vyose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni ukuri nk’ukubaho kwanje, Jewe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Nyeninganji, naho Nowa na Daniyeli na Yobu bobaye ari yo bari, ntiboshoboye gukiza abahungu n’abakobwa babo. Bokwikijije bo ubwabo, kubera ukugororoka kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
